# Files whose SHA-256 is frozen (docs/prereg/ materials, the python sources, the requirement files) and everything else under python/ (README, shell scripts, test data:
# they enter the python/ tree hash) keep their exact bytes on every checkout:
# no end-of-line conversion on any platform, whatever the user's core.autocrlf is.  (-text is not "binary": diffs and review work as usual.)
# Do NOT renormalize the repository: matrix.csv is registered with its CRLF bytes (SHA-256 5cbd4e7b...0dfe).  Any new extra-frozen path
# must be covered by a rule here before the freeze.
/.gitattributes -text
/docs/prereg/** -text
/python/** -text
/python/**/*.py -text
/python/*requirements*.txt -text
/python/scripts/*requirements*.txt -text
